    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nLocated in Moyleen, Loughrea, Co. Galway, this attractive four-bedroom detached residence enjoys a peaceful and scenic countryside setting while remaining exceptionally convenient to all amenities. Situated just 5 minutes from Loughrea town, the property offers the perfect balance of rural tranquillity and easy access to shops, schools, services and recreational facilities.\n\nThis well-proportioned family home offers excellent potential and is sure to appeal to those seeking a comfortable detached residence in a desirable and convenient location.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and can be arranged through sole selling agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nFront Porch - 0.84m x 3.41m\nFront and side aspect windows and door, wooden flooring\n\nHallway - 3.76m x 3.44m\nFront aspect windows and door, hotpress/airing cupboard off, parquet flooring\n\nSitting Room - 3.72m x 4.44m\nFront aspect window, solid fuel insert stove, wooden flooring\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 3.34m x 4.47m\nRear aspect window, wall and base units, tile flooring\n\nUtility/Kitchen - 2.71m x 2.75m\nSide aspect window, wall and base units, tile flooring\n\nHallway - 0.91m x 1.01m\nDoor to rear, tile flooring\n\nGroundfloor wc - 0.93m x 1.64m\nSide aspect window, whb/wc, walls partially tiled, floor tiled\n\nReception/Study - 3.34m x 3.39m\nRear aspect window, wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.33m x 2.81m\nRear aspect window, carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.76m x 2.47m\nFront aspect window, carpet flooring\n\nBathroom - 3.32m x 1.56m\nRear aspect window, whb/wc/bath, floor to ceiling tiles\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.37m x 3.40m\nRear aspect window, fitted wardrobe, carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.72m x 4.40m\nFront aspect window, carpet flooring\n\nGarage - 5.26m x 2.70m\nSide aspect widow, door to front, access to main house\n\nGarden - \nLarge laid to lawn mature garden, patio area, boundary fencing and hedging\n\n"
